    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia akhola naikara eye Pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Yosia aakhola e Pasaka khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mu Yerusalemu. Limeeme lie e Pasaka lierwa khu ndaalo ekhola ekhumi ne chine eye kumwesi kwe khunyoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia arobora basaayi bakhole kimilimo kiabwe mala abaramo kumwoyo khukhola kimilimo mu nju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboolela Balawi babekisianga Baisiraeli boosi lundi ba baba batakatifu khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali, “Khemure Lisanduku litakatifu mu nju niyo Solomoni okhwa Daudi, omwami owa Isiraeli ombakha. Se mwenyekhana khulisuta khu mabeka lundi tawe. Luno khemukholele Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe ne babaandu bewe ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 8.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yirekekha mwabene khuloondekhana ne lisaaye lienywe ne kimikaanda kienywe, muloonde niko omwami Daudi ne omusoleeli wewe Solomoni baloma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yiima Abuundu Atakatifu khuloondekhana ne lisaaye lie bawandaayenywe bakhali Balawi tawe. Mala mwimeo mu bweyaangu bwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiira kamameeme ke e Pasaka ne mumalile khukhwitakaasa khulwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Rekekha balebe benywe, bakhole khuloondekhana ne likhuwa lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khubirira khu Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yosia aelesia Baisiraeli kamakheese ne chimbusi bioosi alala chielefu kamakhumi kataru khulwe biianwa bie e Pasaka. Lundi aabaelesia chikhaafu chiuunwa chielefu chitaru. Bino bioosi biama mwituuli lio mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi ba Yosia bosi baana ne kumwoyo kwoosi khu baandu, basaayi, ne khu Balawi. Hilikia, Sakaria, ne Yehieli, babemeelesi bakhulu be nju eya Wele, baelesia basaayi kamameeme ne chimbusi chielefu chibili ne chimia sita ne chiuunwa chimia chitaru khulwe biianwa bie e Pasaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi be Balawi: Konania ne bawandaaye babili: Shemaya ne Nesaheli, ne Hashabia, Yeieli ne Yosabati baelesia Balawi kamakheese ne chimbusi chielefu chiraano ne chiuunwa chimia chiraano khulwe biianwa bie e Pasaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga buli sisiindu ne siarekekhwa khulwe e Pasaka, basaayi bacha mu bweyaangu bwabwe ne Balawi bacha mu bipupu biabwe khuloondekhana nga omwami ne alaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beera limeeme lie e Pasaka mala basaayi baanyaka kamalasile niko banyoola khukhwama khu Balawi. Balawi babaaka kamakheese ne chimbusi bie e pasaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bara alubeka biianwa bie khukhwosia nio babielesie bipupu bie khu biaana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga liaandikwa mu sitabu sia Musa. Bakhola bario chakhaba ne chiuunwa chosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 12.8-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Boosia limeeme lie e Pasaka khu mulilo khuloondekhana ne lilaka mala bateekha biianwa bitakatifu mu ndekhelo, mu pinika ne khunjo. Nio baelesia khangu babaandu chinyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa lino Balawi barekekha enyama yabwe babene ne eye basaayi, be lisaaye lia Aruni. Enyuma wako Balawi bababikhila chinyama sikila basaayi bakhola kimilimo khukhwola mu silo; baana biianwa bie khukhwosia ne khukhwosia kiminawa kie mbosio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ke Ch. 25.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Babeembi be kimienya be nju eya Asafu bema mu bweyaangu khuloondekhana ne lilaka lio mwami Daudi ne lia Asafu, Hemani, ne Yedutuni owe kamalola owo mwami. Baliindi be bilibwa baba buli a silibwa. Se benyekhana balekhe kimilimo kiabwe tawe, sikila Balawi basiaabwe baba babarekekheele buli sisiindu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio kimilimo kia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi koosi kiarekekhwa endaalo eyo. Kiarekekhwa khulwe khukhola e Pasaka ne khuaana biianwa bie khukhwosia khu alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khuloondekhana ne lilaka lio mwami Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 12.1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baisiraeli ba babayo baba bakhola e Pasaka khu siise esio ne naikara eye kumukaati kukhalimo limela tawe, khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Pasaka nga eyo erio se yaba yayikholekhakho mu Isiraeli ta, mukhwama mu ndaalo cho omung'oosi Samweli. Mbao omwami owa Isiraeli owaba ne akholakho e Pasaka nga niio mwami Yosia, basaayi, Balawi, babaandu boosi ba Yuda ne Isiraeli ba babayo, ne babaandu ba Yerusalemu bakhola tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kwe likhumi ne munaane, kwe khukhwamiia khwa Yosia, e Pasaka yino yakholwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sisiakamo sie khukhwamiia khwa Yosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wa kano koosi, Yosia ne aarekekhe Lukaangu, Neko omwami owa Misiri acha khukhwibwaakala Karikemishi, lukoba luli khu sikiingi sie luluuchi lwa Efurati. Ne Yosia arura khukhwibwaakala Neko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Neko aruma barumwa khu Yosia ne aloma ali, “Liie likhaba akari wefwe tawe. Ese se nechile khukhupana ne nawe tawe ne kakhali ese nechile khukhupana ne basiku base. Wele andakile khole khangu. Lekha khuyingania Wele oli ne nase akhola ario akhubunia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kaba kario Yosia se arurayo aukha amulekha tawe. Yosia efwara chingubo chichiindi ekaluukhasia nio omundu akhamumanya ne ali niye tawe. Se aulila kamakhuwa ka Neko, khuloondekhana ne lilaka lia Wele tawe. Yosia acha khukhupana khu mweyeeywe kwa Mekido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu liie balasi be buembo balasa omwami Yosia. Yosia aboolela bakholi bewe ali, “Mbukule mundusie ano sikila bandasile burafu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
