              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bakholi bewe bamubukula bamurusia mwikaari liewe lie liie, bamura mu liindi mala bamuyila e Yerusalemu. Afwila ebweeneyo mala asiikhwa mu biliindwa bie bakuuka bewe. Babaandu boosi ba Yuda ne Yerusalemu balila Yosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        }
