              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omung'oosi Yeremia yesi aakhola kimienya kie lilila khu Yosia. Babeembi boosi be kimienya be siseecha ne siikhasi balomalomanga khu Yosia mu mienya kiabwe khukhwola luno. Bakhola lino liaba lilaka mu Isiraeli kimienya kino kiaandikwa mu mienya kie bubeeleli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        }
